  "notes": "Seeed 'Pinout' of the Expansion Board Base for XIAO (render without the XIAO module fitted). Header labels: board names D0-D10 chosen as labels; silkscreen digit first in functions, then callouts read outward (A-number, then SPI/IIC/UART/DAC). Callout 'MOSI' appears on both columns 10 and 9 as printed. Silkscreen names SCLI5, SDAI4, TXI6, RXI7 recorded as printed (the 'I' may be a separator). Connector-level callouts: IIC groves 'A5, D5, IIC'; A0-D0 grove 'A0, D0'; UART grove 'UART, A7, D7'. Skipped: 3.7V LiPo battery connector (+/- only), RTC chip, buttons, buzzer, power switch."
